00:27:02,185 --> 00:27:03,206
Step five.

861
00:27:03,386 --> 00:27:04,617
Write down your rules.

862
00:27:04,797 --> 00:27:07,630
No car purchases over a certain amount.

863
00:27:07,810 --> 00:27:10,450
No single investment over a few percent

864
00:27:10,450 --> 00:27:11,397
of your money.

865
00:27:11,577 --> 00:27:12,885
No loans to friends,

866
00:27:12,885 --> 00:27:15,107
only gifts within a yearly budget.

867
00:27:15,287 --> 00:27:17,377
No moving money because of an urgent

868
00:27:17,377 --> 00:27:18,015
